<title>GERMANY: Wella sees 25 pct profits rise in 1997.</title>
<headline>Wella sees 25 pct profits rise in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German haircare group Wella AG said on Tuesday that it expected its profit for 1997 to rise by 25 percent compared with 1996.</p>
<p>The group earlier reported a rise in 1996 net profit to 78.04 million marks versus 74.15 million marks previously.</p>
<p>Wella also said its sales for the first quarter of this year were up 10 percent and up 11.8 percent when adjusted for purchases.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 7565 1246</p>
